('JEE Main','Physics','Current Electricity','medium','Three resistors 3Ω, 6Ω, 9Ω are in parallel. Equivalent resistance is:','["1.64 Ω","18 Ω","2 Ω","3 Ω"]',0,'1/R=1/3+1/6+1/9=6/18+3/18+2/18=11/18 → R≈1.64 Ω.','NCERT Class 12',2023),
('JEE Main','Physics','Current Electricity','hard','A Wheatstone bridge has P=10Ω, Q=20Ω, R=30Ω. For balance, S equals:','["60 Ω","15 Ω","40 Ω","6 Ω"]',0,'P/Q=R/S → 10/20=30/S → S=60 Ω.','NCERT Class 12',2022),
