('JEE Main','Physics','Magnetism','hard','A solenoid has 1000 turns, length 0.5 m, carries 2 A. Magnetic field inside (μ₀=4π×10⁻⁷):','["5.03×10⁻³ T","2.51×10⁻³ T","1.26×10⁻² T","1.00×10⁻³ T"]',0,'B=μ₀nI=4π×10⁻⁷×2000×2=5.03×10⁻³ T.','NCERT Class 12',2023),
('JEE Main','Physics','Electromagnetic Induction','medium','A coil of 200 turns and area 0.05 m² rotates at 50 Hz in B=0.1 T. Peak EMF is:','["314 V","157 V","100 V","628 V"]',0,'ε₀=NBAω=200×0.1×0.05×2π×50=314 V.','NCERT Class 12',2022),
('JEE Main','Physics','Optics','easy','A convex lens of focal length 20 cm forms a real image. The object distance is 30 cm. Image distance is:','["60 cm","40 cm","30 cm","15 cm"]',0,'1/v−1/u=1/f; 1/v=1/20+1/(−30)=1/60; v=60 cm.','NCERT Class 12',2023),
('JEE Main','Physics','Optics','medium','Light passes from glass (n=1.5) to water (n=1.33). Critical angle is:','["62.5°","48.8°","41.8°","56.3°"]',0,'sin C=n₂/n₁=1.33/1.5=0.887 → C≈62.5°.','NCERT Class 12',2024),
('JEE Main','Physics','Optics','hard','In Youngs double slit experiment (λ=600 nm, d=1 mm, D=1 m), fringe width is:','["0.6 mm","0.3 mm","1.2 mm","0.06 mm"]',0,'β=λD/d=600×10⁻⁹×1/10⁻³=0.6 mm.','NCERT Class 12',2023),
('JEE Main','Physics','Modern Physics','easy','Photoelectric effect proves light has:','["Wave nature","Particle nature","Both","Neither"]',1,'Photoelectric effect demonstrates quantization of light energy — particle (photon) nature.','NCERT Class 12',2022),
('JEE Main','Physics','Modern Physics','medium','De Broglie wavelength of an electron accelerated through 100 V (m=9.1×10⁻³¹, h=6.63×10⁻³⁴):','["0.123 nm","1.23 nm","0.0123 nm","12.3 nm"]',0,'λ=h/√(2meV)=6.63×10⁻³⁴/√(2×9.1×10⁻³¹×1.6×10⁻¹⁹×100)≈0.123 nm.','NCERT Class 12',2024),
