('JEE Main','Physics','Simple Harmonic Motion','medium','A spring-mass system (k=100 N/m, m=1 kg) oscillates. Period is:','["π/5 s","2π/10 s","0.628 s","1 s"]',2,'T=2π√(m/k)=2π/10=0.628 s.','NCERT Class 11',2024),
